 21: | 24-404 | Costa Norte | César Caballero |
 22: | 25-505 | Paraíso | César Caballero |
 23: | 25-506 | Muelle 14 | Franklin Marciaga |
 24: | 26-604 | Inyecciones Metro | TBD |
