 89:     // 1. Line has qty=5
 90:     // 2. Trip assigns qty=3 (qty_scheduled=3)
 91:     // 3. At dispatch, conductor changes to qty_dispatched=2
 92:     // 4. Backlog should show qty_pending = 5 - 2 = 3 (using qty_dispatched)
 93:     // 5. Currently shows qty_pending = 5 - 3 = 2 (using qty_scheduled) ← BUG
 94: 
 95:     // Create a fresh solicitud for this test
