215: ## §5 Components & data flow
216: 
217: ### `useExternal.ts`
218: 
219: ```typescript
220: interface ApproveExternalResult { ok: boolean; error?: string }
221: interface ConvertLineExternalResult { ok: boolean; tripCancelled?: boolean; error?: string }
222: interface CompleteExternalResult { ok: boolean; error?: string }
223: interface RevertExternalResult { ok: boolean; error?: string }
224: 
225: function useExternal() {
226:   // approveExternal: línea Pendiente → Externo Aprobado (sin Trip)
227:   // convertLineToExternal: línea Programada → Externo Aprobado (DELETE assignment + UPDATE atómico, auto-cancela trip si era última)
228:   // completeExternal: Externo Aprobado → Entregada (qty_delivered=quantity, append notes/attachments, persiste receptor en columnas dedicadas)
229:   // revertExternalToBacklog: Externo Aprobado → Pendiente (preserva external_invoice_attachments)
230:   return { loading, error, approveExternal, convertLineToExternal, completeExternal, revertExternalToBacklog }
231: }
232: ```
233: 
234: **`completeExternal` UPDATE shape (canónico)**:
235: 
236: ```typescript
237: .update({
238:   status: 'Entregada',
239:   qty_delivered: line.quantity,            // todo-o-nada (paralelo a pickup)
240:   external_completed_at: now,
241:   external_received_by_id: receivedById,   // null OK (no XOR)
242:   external_received_by_name: receivedByName?.trim() || null,  // null OK (no XOR)
243:   delivered_at: now,
244:   external_invoice_attachments: [...existingAttachments, ...newAttachments],  // append simple, no metadata distintiva
245:   external_notes: finalNotes,              // append: existing + '\n\n[Entrega <ISO>] <user notes>'
246: })
247: .eq('id', lineId)
248: ```
249: 
250: **Diferencias clave vs `completePickup`**:
251: - Receptor NO es XOR: ambos `received_by_*` pueden ser NULL (factura es prueba primaria)
252: - Persistencia en columnas dedicadas `external_received_by_*` (no reuso polimórfico de `pickup_received_by_*`)
253: - Append a `external_invoice_attachments` (no a `attachments` JSONB genérico)
254: - Append a `external_notes` (no a `notes` genérico de la línea)
