329: ### Data flow Surface 1 (BacklogTable approve)
330: 
331: ```
332: User click "Aprobar viaje externo" en BacklogTable row
333:   → onApproveExternal(lineId) prop callback
334:   → setExternalApproveModal({ lineId }) en programacion/page.tsx
335:   → Modal inline render con <ExternalApprovalForm values={...} onChange={...} />
336:   → User completa fields → validateApprovalForm() en submit
337:   → useExternal.approveExternal(lineId, person.id, providerName, amount, attachments, notes)
338:   → BD UPDATE atómico
339:   → Si ok: setExternalApproveModal(null), refetchBacklog(), refetchPendingExternals()
340:   → Si error: set pickup.error → mostrado en modal
341: ```
342: 
343: ### Data flow Surface 2 (AssignmentRow convert)
344: 
345: ```
346: User click "Convertir a externo" en AssignmentRow
347:   → onConvertToExternal(lineId, assignmentId, qtyAssigned, qtyDelivered) prop callback
348:   → setExternalConvertModal({ ..., willCancelTrip: existingAssignments.length === 1 })
349:   → Modal inline render con header danger condicional + <ExternalApprovalForm />
350:   → Si qtyDelivered > 0: bloqueo con mensaje claro, sin form
351:   → User completa fields → validateApprovalForm() en submit
352:   → useExternal.convertLineToExternal(...)
353:   → BD: DELETE assignment + UPDATE línea atomic
354:   → Si ok && tripCancelled: redirect /programacion
355:   → Si ok && !tripCancelled: refetch trip + backlog
356: ```
357: 
358: ### Data flow Surface 3 (sección + delivery + revert)
359: 
360: ```
361: useEffect on mount: refetchPendingExternals() para logistica/admin
362:   → SELECT sm_request_lines WHERE external_by_provider=true AND external_completed_at IS NULL
363:   → ORDER BY external_approved_at ASC (FIFO)
364:   → setPendingExternals(...)
365: 
366: User click "Confirmar entrega" en row
367:   → setExternalDeliveryLine(line)
368:   → <ExternalDeliveryModal line={...} />
369:   → User completa form (confirmation required, resto opcional)
370:   → useExternal.completeExternal(lineId, receivedById, receivedByName, notes, additionalAttachments)
371:   → BD UPDATE atomic con append notes + concat attachments
372:   → Si ok: setExternalDeliveryLine(null), refetchPendingExternals()
373:   → cascade_request_status trigger cierra solicitud si todas las líneas Entregadas
374: 
375: User click "Devolver al backlog" en row
376:   → setExternalRevertLine(line)
377:   → Modal inline "¿Devolver al backlog?"
378:   → useExternal.revertExternalToBacklog(lineId)
379:   → BD UPDATE atomic con WHERE status='Externo Aprobado' AND external_completed_at IS NULL
380:   → external_* a NULL excepto external_invoice_attachments
381:   → Si ok: refetchPendingExternals(), refetchBacklog()
382: ```
