488: ### Data flow per surface
489: 
490: **Surface 1 (Bulk approve from backlog)**:
491: ```
492: User selects N lines in BacklogTable
493:   → toolbar bulk appears con badge "{N} líneas seleccionadas"
494:   → click "Aprobar pickup"
495:   → setCreatePickupOrderModal({ lines: selected })
496:   → Modal renders <CreatePickupOrderModal selectedLines={...} />
497:   → User adjusts qty per line + adds notas
498:   → submit → validate (qty > 0 & <= available)
499:   → usePickupOrders.createPickupOrder({ charrisId, lines, notes })
500:   → BD: INSERT pickup_orders + INSERT pickup_order_lines (transaction)
501:   → Trigger BD recalcula sm_request_lines.qty_scheduled automáticamente
502:   → Si ok: close modal + clear selection + refetchBacklog + refetchPendingPickupOrders + toast "Pickup PKP-2026-N aprobado"
503: ```
504: 
505: **Confirm Delivery (de Surface 3 o /solicitudes/[id])**:
506: ```
507: User clicks "Confirmar entrega" en PickupOrderCard
508:   → setConfirmDeliveryOrder(order)
509:   → Modal renders <ConfirmPickupOrderDeliveryModal order={...} />
510:   → User llena receptor opcional + notas + foto adicional
511:   → submit
512:   → usePickupOrders.completePickupOrder(orderId, completedById, receivedById, receivedByName, notes, attachments)
513:   → BD: UPDATE pickup_orders.status='Entregado' + UPDATE pickup_order_lines.qty_delivered=quantity_assigned
514:   → Trigger recalcula sm_request_lines.qty_delivered + status (Entregada/Parcial)
515:   → Si ok: close modal + refetchPendingPickupOrders + refetchSolicitud (si /solicitudes/[id]) + toast "Entrega registrada"
516: ```
517: 
518: **Cancel Order**:
519: ```
520: User clicks "Cancelar pickup" en PickupOrderCard
521:   → Hook pre-fetch: cancelPickupOrder pre-flight stats SELECT
522:   → Si deliveredCount > 0: confirmation modal con copy contextual
523:      "Cancelar este pickup va a devolver al backlog las líneas no entregadas.
524:       Las {deliveredCount} líneas ya entregadas ({deliveredQty} unidades en total)
525:       quedan registradas como entregadas (no se invierten). ¿Confirmar?"
526:   → Si deliveredCount = 0: confirmation modal simple
527:      "¿Cancelar pickup PKP-2026-N? Las líneas volverán al backlog."
528:   → User confirms
529:   → usePickupOrders.cancelPickupOrder(orderId, cancelledById)
530:   → BD: UPDATE pickup_orders.status='Cancelado'
531:   → Trigger recalcula líneas: qty_scheduled de no-entregadas → 0; qty_delivered HISTÓRICA preservada
532:   → Si ok: close modal + refetchPendingPickupOrders + refetchBacklog + toast
533: ```
534: 
535: **Remove Line (auto-cancel-empty)**:
536: ```
537: User clicks "Quitar línea" en card expanded view (si UI lo permite — D8 diferido)
538: O eliminación implícita via cancelar solicitud (G refactor)
539:   → usePickupOrders.removeLineFromPickupOrder(orderId, lineId)
540:   → BD: DELETE FROM pickup_order_lines WHERE id=lineId
541:   → Trigger BD: si era la última línea, auto_cancel_empty_pickup_order cancela el order
542:   → Hook post-DELETE: SELECT count of remaining lines
543:      Si count = 0: { ok: true, orderCancelled: true, orderId: 'PKP-...' }
544:   → UI: si orderCancelled, toast "Pickup PKP-2026-N cancelado al eliminar última línea"
545: ```
546: 
547: **LineRow badges (E)**:
548: ```
549: useSolicitudes.fetchSolicitud query con LEFT JOIN
550:   → fulfillments[] populated con info per fulfillment activo
551:   → LineRow recibe prop fulfillments
552:   → Render N badges según tipo:
553:     - trip: "EN VIAJE {trip_id}" green-100 / green-700 + tooltip "Trip {trip_id}, {qty} {unit}"
554:     - pickup: "EN PICKUP {pickup_id}" blue-100 / blue-700 + tooltip "Pickup {pickup_id}, {qty} {unit}"
555:     - external: "EN EXTERNO {external_id}" violet-100 / violet-700 + tooltip "Externo {external_id}, B/. {amount}, {provider}, {qty} {unit}"
556:   - Para línea Entregada con qty_delivered > 0: badge "ENTREGADA" emerald + tooltip listando contributors
557: ```
558: 
559: **cancelSolicitud refactor (G)**:
560: ```
561: useSolicitudes.cancelSolicitud(solicitudId)
562:   → SELECT pickup_orders activos con líneas en esta solicitud (JOIN pickup_order_lines + sm_request_lines WHERE request_id=solicitudId AND po.status NOT IN ('Cancelado'))
563:   → Para cada pickup_order:
564:     SELECT count of lines from THIS solicitud / count of total lines
565:     Si all == total: cancelPickupOrder(orderId, cancelledById)
566:     Si all < total: DELETE FROM pickup_order_lines WHERE pickup_order_id=X AND request_line_id IN (líneas de la solicitud)
567:        (auto_cancel_empty trigger maneja el caso si quedan 0 líneas)
568:   → Mismo proceso para external_orders
569:   → UPDATE sm_request_lines.status='Cancelada' para líneas de la solicitud no entregadas
570:   → UPDATE sm_requests.status='Cancelada'
571:   → UI feedback: toast "Solicitud cancelada. {N} pickup_orders afectados, {M} external_orders afectados"
572: ```
